  (label "VP  (drive rail)" (at 16.0 57.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6839a62d-8357-49ba-ae72-66c4027b179b"))
  (label "OUT  (to HEMT gate)" (at 16.0 197.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4c55fcec-9aec-4c02-859c-c246e9a545c6"))
  (label "VN  (tied to ref — NO negative rail)" (at 16.0 337.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "48ce7881-4dc2-4d2f-9ab7-d0134dbc9c98"))
  (text "BASE PAPER — segmented gate driver, our reimplementation" (at 44 20 0) (effects (font (size 3.2 3.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "10736127-14f6-48ff-9126-db1abbca51b8"))
  (text "Zhang, Yu, Leng, Cui, Deng, Ng.  ISPSD 2020, pp. 102-105.  7 slices per bank, engaged in TWO stages." (at 44 27 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66fe97d4-f150-4f58-a4ce-d8b08d461d56"))
  (text "STAGE 1  —  engaged immediately" (at 129.0 44.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.4 2.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7a7427b5-0809-4d40-9dbd-fc9c535bebb9"))
  (text "STAGE 2  —  joins at the pattern step" (at 363.0 44.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.4 2.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9f187101-6944-477f-b12c-46cc802eaf86"))
  (text "HOW THEIR CONTROL WORKS, AND WHY THIS SHEET IS WIDER THAN OURS." (at 44 364.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "61141290-6bca-4906-ab24-28d891a48dc4"))
  (text "The two stages are separate branches in the netlist, so 7 slices per bank means 14" (at 44 369.6 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d5b43071-1bfb-4c8f-811a-cbb435cf245e"))
  (text "columns. A stage-2 branch carries an EXTRA switch in series, gated by the pattern" (at 44 375.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "34a6e8d9-6466-43c4-82b9-7e126fb56195"))
  (text "step (seg) rather than by the drive command. That extra switch is the paper's" (at 44 380.80000000000007 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3b0ad6e4-6a69-41bc-b59e-4ba76b3bcd20"))
  (text "mechanism: nseg slices engage at the edge and the remaining 5 join TSTEP later." (at 44 386.4000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b631cfa2-df65-42d8-a8c7-10d887b39cef"))
  (text "" (at 44 392.0000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "71f80dce-e05d-4fe8-9997-0b86a12a92b6"))
  (text "The split, and therefore the whole pattern, is set by ONE external bias resistor" (at 44 397.60000000000014 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4d5a7222-73ce-422a-a715-5daf4c44b4ae"))
  (text "chosen at design time. That single knob is the paper's contribution and is what" (at 44 403.20000000000016 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9417f7f5-3c56-47f8-8170-5b83df818073"))
  (text "'Simple Driving Strength Pattern Control' in its title refers to." (at 44 408.8000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "68d58fa6-e8b4-4033-bf84-d8b8afa17ed6"))
  (text "" (at 44 414.4000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bf204c8e-4e1f-45a5-8589-2ef40c23c5e7"))
  (text "WHAT IS ABSENT HERE, WHICH IS THE COMPARISON.  There is no clamp branch and no" (at 44 420.0000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b583cca8-e4d7-4e60-a9d9-744d0f1a799a"))
  (text "negative off rail: VN is tied to the local reference. Put this sheet beside" (at 44 425.60000000000025 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2c4f864f-0002-4ce2-bcf1-95115a832035"))
  (text "kicad/gan_segdrv.kicad_sch and those two additions are the whole difference." (at 44 431.2000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "64c9bdf6-57de-4ae2-a9ea-fde4669d5428"))
  (text "" (at 44 436.8000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "247166f7-1be6-4f26-9bc4-7dedcccc8676"))
  (text "INFERRED, NOT STATED BY THE PAPER.  The ISPSD paper is four pages and gives no" (at 44 442.4000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e378e937-0fdb-4b0d-bf6b-44e1f1da1063"))
  (text "slice sizing. Equal-sized slices and an nseg/(7-nseg) split are our reading." (at 44 448.00000000000034 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f1b6e208-adcb-46c1-a7a7-05c3741015e5"))
  (text "Both are the most generous simple reading of 'pattern control', so neither" (at 44 453.60000000000036 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f2d5667b-3b52-4c72-bb0b-2695456573f7"))
  (text "assumption favours our result." (at 44 459.2000000000004 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5675d60b-ca72-468a-8ffe-c7e150ce013b"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
